{"id":"torrey:children-wicked","source":"torrey","name":"Children, Wicked","slug":"children-wicked","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Know not God — 1Sa 2:12.","refs":[["1Sam",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Are void of understanding — Pr 7:7.","refs":[["Prov",7,7,7,7]]},{"text":"Are proud — Isa 3:5.","refs":[["Isa",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Hearken not to them. — 1Sa 2:25.","refs":[["1Sam",2,25,2,25]]},{"text":"Despise them. — Pr 15:5,20; Eze 22:7.","refs":[["Prov",15,5,15,5],["Prov",15,20,15,20],["Ezek",22,7,22,7]]},{"text":"Curse them. — Pr 30:11.","refs":[["Prov",30,11,30,11]]},{"text":"Bring reproach on them. — Pr 19:26.","refs":[["Prov",19,26,19,26]]},{"text":"Are a calamity to them. — Pr 19:13.","refs":[["Prov",19,13,19,13]]},{"text":"Are a grief to them. — Pr 17:25.","refs":[["Prov",17,25,17,25]]},{"text":"Despised their elders. — Job 19:18.","refs":[["Job",19,18,19,18]]},{"text":"Setting light by parents. — De 27:16.","refs":[["Deut",27,16,27,16]]},{"text":"Disobeying parents. — De 21:21.","refs":[["Deut",21,21,21,21]]},{"text":"Mocking parents. — Pr 30:17.","refs":[["Prov",30,17,30,17]]},{"text":"Cursing parents. — Ex 21:15; Mr 7:10.","refs":[["Exod",21,15,21,15],["Mark",7,10,7,10]]},{"text":"Smiting parents. — Ex 21:15.","refs":[["Exod",21,15,21,15]]},{"text":"Mocking of a prophet. — 2Ki 2:23,24.","refs":[["2Kgs",2,23,2,23],["2Kgs",2,24,2,24]]},{"text":"Gluttony and drunkenness. — De 21:20,21.","refs":[["Deut",21,20,21,20],["Deut",21,21,21,21]]},{"text":"Their guilt in robbing parents — Pr 28:24.","refs":[["Prov",28,24,28,24]]},{"text":"Esau. — Ge 26:34,35.","refs":[["Gen",26,34,26,34],["Gen",26,35,26,35]]},{"text":"Sons of Eli. — 1Sa 2:,12,17.","refs":[["1Sam",2,0,2,0]]},{"text":"Sons of Samuel. — 1Sa 8:3.","refs":[["1Sam",8,3,8,3]]},{"text":"Absalom. — 2Sa 15:10.","refs":[["2Sam",15,10,15,10]]},{"text":"Adonijah. — 1Ki 1:5,6.","refs":[["1Kgs",1,5,1,5],["1Kgs",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Children at Bethel. — 2Ki 2:23.","refs":[["2Kgs",2,23,2,23]]},{"text":"Adrammelech and Share